<title>FINLAND: RAUTAKIRJA SEES LOWER 1997 EARNINGS.</title>
<headline>RAUTAKIRJA SEES LOWER 1997 EARNINGS.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish retailer Rautakirja Oy said on Thursday its earnings were expected to fall slightly in 1997 on 1996, but its net sales were expected to rise about two percent.</p>
<p>&quot;Group earnings are expected to be slightly below the previous year due to rising investments and declining financial gains ... net sales are expected to grow some two percent during 1997,&quot; Rautakirja said in a statement with its 1996 report.</p>
<p>Rautakirja's 1996 profit before extraordinary items and tax was 214.8 million markka, up from 195.3 million. Its net sales rose to 3.24 billion markka in 1996 from 3.28 billion.  </p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0248, news@Reuters.fi</p>
